[6359]="700561DB\n1\tHabla con Burginda\tBurginda can be found at Edoras or the Kingstead neighbourhoods. You should talk to Burginda.\n",
[6360]="7006EC21\n1\tHacer las camas (total: 4)\030Lavar los suelos (total: 4)\tDarôma te ha ofrecido pagarte si haces las camas y limpias los suelos en las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Jarra Agrietada.\n2\tHabla con Darôma\tHas hecho las camas y lavado los suelos de las habitaciones de huéspedes de la Jarra Agrietada. Deberías volver a ver a Darôma dentro de la posada para recoger tu recompensa.\n",
[6361]="700555A6\n1\tDestroy ritual tomes (total: 8)\tRitual tomes can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the ritual tomes.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed ritual tomes within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6362]="700555A5\n1\tDestroy roots of Morloth (total: 8)\tRoots of Morloth can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the far reaching roots.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed roots of Morloth within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6363]="700555A7\n1\tDestroy blood reserves (total: 8)\tBlood reserves can be found in Bâr Nírnaeth, the Houses of Lamentation. You should destroy the blood reserves.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed blood reserves within Bâr Nírnaeth.\n",
[6364]="700261E1\n1\tHabla con Maengamiel en el Jardín del Festival\tEl Elfo Maengamiel se encuentra en el Jardín de Duillond, observando impotente el campo infestado de musarañas. Debes contarle a Maengamiel la propuesta de Bodo Madrigueras.\n2\tHabla con Nibs Coto en la Granja Coto en Delagua\030Habla con Wald Arenilla en la Granja Arenilla\030Habla con el Anciano en Hobbiton\tNibs Coto está en la granja de los Coto, en Delagua, mientras que Wald Arenilla está en la granja de los Arenilla, cerca de Cavada Grande. El Anciano Hamfast Gamyi está en Hobbiton, por supuesto. Debes hablar con los jardineros de la Comarca para aprender cómo tratan los hobbits a las musarañas.\n3\tHabla con Maengamiel en el Jardín del Festival\tMaengamiel está en el Jardín del Festival en Duillond, supervisando el caos provocado por las musarañas. Debes contarle a Maengamiel lo que aprendiste de los tres jardineros hobbits.\n",
[6365]="7005857D\n1\tDefeat Wargs at Howlers' Notch (total: 12)\tHowlers' Notch can be found in central Elderslade. You should defeat Wargs at Howlers' Notch.\n2\tDefeat the den mother\tThe den mother can be found inside the cave at Howler's Notch. Defeat the den mother.\n3\tReturn to Gunvald\tGunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. Return to Gunvald.\n",
[6366]="70058743\n1\tBreak chains\tChains can be found at Howlers' Notch. You should break chains that you find at Howlers' Notch.\n2\tBreak chains (total: 8)\tChains can be found at Howlers' Notch. You should break chains that you find at Howlers' Notch.\n3\tCompletado\tBroke many chains at Howlers' Notch.\n",
[6367]="70058747\n1\tBurn slop piles\tSlop piles can be found scattered around Howlers' Notch. You should burn any slop piles that you find.\n2\tBurn slop piles (total: 12)\tSlop piles can be found scattered around Howlers' Notch. You should burn any slop piles that you find.\n3\tCompletado\tBurned many slop piles at Howlers' Notch.\n",
[6368]="7004DA22\n1\tDefeat wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands (total: 10)\tWolves can be found in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands. You should defeat wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many wolves in Eryn Lasgalen and the Dale-lands.\n",
